WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:02.235 line:0%
.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.807 line:0%
CNN RETURN TO HIS IRISH

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.308 line:0%
HOMETOWN TO SEE HOW THESE

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:08.742 line:0%
FAMILIES ARE.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:13.546 line:0%
ADJUSTING

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:14.447 line:0%
 IT MAY BE THOUSANDS OF MILES

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.449 line:0%
AWAY BUT CAHERCIVEEN, MY

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.050 line:0%
HOMETOWN IS JUST ONE PART OF

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.685 line:0%
IRELAND THAT'S BEING

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.085 line:0%
TRANSFORMED BY THE WAR IN

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.422 line:0%
UKRAINE.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.856 line:0%
HELLO, HOW ARE YOU, WHAT'S

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.625 line:0%
GOING ON?

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:28.528 line:0%
I WAS OVER ON A BICYCLE.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:32.532 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SIX WEEKS AGO WE WERE A

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:32.966 line:0%
SCHOOL OF 103 PEOPLE, SEVEN

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.368 line:0%
TEACHERS.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:37.604 line:0%
WE ARRIVED BACK FROM ST.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:39.372 line:0%
PATRICK'S WE CAN, TO A 50%

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:39.839 line:0%
INCREASE IN OUR SCHOOL

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:44.511 line:0%
POPULATION.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:47.714 line:0%
SIX WE LATER, WE HAVE 155

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:50.483 line:0%
PEOPLES, AND TEN TEACHERS.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:51.551 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WITH A POPULATION OF ONLY 5

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.553 line:0%
MILLION PEOPLE, IRELAND HAS

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.521 line:0%
TAKEN IN MORE THAN 25,000

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.556 line:0%
UKRAINIANS FLEEING THE WAR.

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.391 line:0%
HUNDREDS HAVE COME TO

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.492 line:0%
CAHERCIVEEN, AND EVERYONE IS

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.893 line:0%
INVOLVED IN MAKING THEM FEEL

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:02.395 line:0%
WELCOME.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.029 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I COME IN HERE MOSTLY WHEN

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.433 line:0%
CLASSES ARE FINISHED.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.800 line:0%
THERE IS A BEAUTIFUL YOUNG GIRL

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.568 line:0%
HERE.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:10.370 line:0%
SHE'S A CLASSICAL PIANIST.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.538 line:0%
SHE COMES IN AND PLAYS THE

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:14.541 line:0%
PIANO WHEN THE SCHOOLS CLOSED.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.608 line:0%
SHE SERENADES ME FOR AN HOUR OR

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.643 line:0%
TWO IN THE EVENINGS.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.678 line:0%
IT'S FANTASTIC.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.079 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HELLO MR. O'SULLIVAN, HOW

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.747 line:0%
ARE YOU.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:23.616 line:0%
WHERE IS EVERYONE FROM?

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:25.685 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I'M FROM KYIV.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:29.923 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE FROM KYIV?

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:30.390 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG HAVE YOU'VE BEEN IN

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.859 line:0%
CAHERCIVEEN?

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.894 line:0%
&gt;&gt; TWO MONTHS, MAYBE.

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:35.662 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE AN EXCEPTIONALLY

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:37.664 line:0%
TALENTED, PIANO PLAYER.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.465 line:0%
ARE YOU THE PIANO PLAYER?

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:39.732 line:0%
IS THAT YOU?

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:42.435 line:0%
DO YOU PLAY IN HERE?

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:46.706 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:48.541 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AS WELL AS USING TRANSLATION

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:51.377 line:0%
APPS, CAHERCIVEEN HAS HIGHER

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.878 line:0%
TEACHERS TO HELP THE STUDENTS

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.581 line:0%
LEARN ENGLISH.

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.416 line:0%
&gt;&gt; OTHER GENERAL KNOWLEDGE IS

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.684 line:0%
GOOD, IT'S JUST THAT THEY'RE

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.651 line:0%
ENGLISH IS AT A LOWER LEVEL.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.686 line:0%
BUT THEY'RE LIKE SPONGES,

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.787 line:0%
THEY'RE LOVELY CHILDREN.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:03.490 line:0%
THEY'RE ALL SMILES.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:06.526 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AS FOR THE IRISH STUDENTS --

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:08.394 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S A VERY NICE

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.995 line:0%
EXPERIENCE, TO HAVE UKRAINIAN

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.730 line:0%
PEOPLE IN OUR CLASS.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:11.364 line:0%
THEY CAN LEARN FROM US AND WE

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.532 line:0%
CAN LEARN FROM THERE.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.600 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE HAPPY TO HAVE SO MANY

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:14.801 line:0%
NEW PEOPLE IN THE SCHOOL?

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:16.569 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT'S DIFFERENT, AND IT'S A

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.537 line:0%
LOT BUSIER.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.705 line:0%
PEOPLE HAVE NEW FRIENDS NOW.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:19.672 line:0%
IT'S VERY NICE, I LIKE IT.

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:22.575 line:0%
IT'S JUST SO LOVELY.

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.577 line:0%
&gt;&gt; DESPITE LANGUAGE BARRIERS,

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:26.646 line:0%
TO SEE PEOPLE ENGAGING,

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:29.415 line:0%
LEARNING, HAPPY AND LAUGHING.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.384 line:0%
AND ADJUSTING.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:32.619 line:0%
OUR HUGE SUCCESS, TOTALLY

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:35.588 line:0%
BECAUSE OF THE WHOLE COMMUNITY.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:37.357 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ACROSS IRELAND, UKRAINIAN

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:39.459 line:0%
REFUGEES HAVE BEEN PLACED IN

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:40.493 line:0%
HOTELS AND EMERGENCY

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:40.994 line:0%
ACCOMMODATION, AND GRANTED THE

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.363 line:0%
RIGHT TO WORK.

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:47.500 line:0%
DESPITE STRETCHED RESOURCES,

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:48.101 line:0%
MANY LOCAL COMMUNITIES ARE

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:51.371 line:0%
HAPPY TO HAVE THEM.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.705 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN THE SHOP, ABOUT FOUR OR

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:54.674 line:0%
FIVE DAYS AGO, UKRAINIAN FAMILY

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:56.576 line:0%
WAS BUYING STUFF FROM THE SHOP.

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:57.744 line:0%
THEY WERE JUST ABOUT TO PAY THE

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.579 line:0%
BILL, AND A LOCAL GUY STEPPED

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:03.383 line:0%
IN AND SAID, NO.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.950 line:0%
HE HANDED ME HIS CARD AND SAID,

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.685 line:0%
I'M GETTING THAT.

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:08.488 line:0%
THEY WERE IN TEARS.

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:09.656 line:0%
&gt;&gt; LILIA CAME HERE WITH HER TWO

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:11.391 line:0%
CHILDREN AND HAS BEEN

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.791 line:0%
OVERWHELMED BY THE IRISH

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:13.626 line:0%
WELCOME.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.993 line:0%
BUT OF COURSE, STILL YEARNS FOR

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:16.663 line:0%
HOME.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:17.030 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IRISH PEOPLE ASK US, ARE YOU

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.599 line:0%
HAPPY?

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:25.371 line:0%
AND, WE ARE TRYING TO BE HAPPY.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:26.539 line:0%
BECAUSE WE HAVE EVERYTHING,

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:30.443 line:0%
THAT WE NEED NOW, HERE.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:31.444 line:0%
BUT WE DON'T HAVE --

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.647 line:0%
LIFE.

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:35.048 line:0%
IT'S KIND OF DIFFICULT, A

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:38.384 line:0%
LITTLE.

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:38.785 line:0%
&gt;&gt; BACK AT THE SCHOOL, YOU COME

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:41.854 line:0%
IN HERE.

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.288 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS MY DAUGHTER,

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:44.691 line:0%
MARGARITA.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:45.825 line:0%
HER MOM CAME BY TO WATCH HER

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:47.594 line:0%
DAUGHTER PERFORM FOR SOME OF

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:47.994 line:0%
HER NEW IRISH AND UKRAINIAN

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.431 line:0%
FRIENDS.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:56.431 line:0%
.

